ral alteration**\n\n**3) X-AI module**\n- Confidence interpretation: the pipeline reports a **very high-confidence signal**, but also explicitly notes that imaging analysis **is not a definitive diagnosis**\n- Summary: the pipeline output suggests a **high likelihood of kidney cancer** based on the image pattern\n- Visual evidence: it reports detection of a **kidney tumor-like region**\n- Recommended next steps:\n  1. Further medical evaluation with imaging and lab tests\n  2. Discussion with a clinician/urologist/radiologist\n  3. Consider confirmatory testing if your care team thinks it is appropriate\n\n**Important note**\nThis is a **preliminary prototype tool output, not an actual diagnosis**. It can be useful as a signal, but confirmation needs proper clinical review and formal imaging interpretation.\n\n**References from the pipeline**\n- American Cancer Society — *Kidney Cancer: Diagnosis and Treatment* (2022)  \n  https://www.cancer.org/cancer/kidney-cancer/detection-diagnosis-staging.html\n- European Association of Urology — *Kidney Cancer* (2020)  \n  https://uroweb.org/guideline/kidney-cancer/\n\nIf you want, I can next:\n- give you a **plain-English interpretation** of what these results may mean, or\n- help you run the **LLM Distillation** step to turn this tool output into a more complete patient-facing report with suggested next steps.\n\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b862e0a6fbd73a6254e5be/b0f1c107-0576-49f4-985a-1754b3411728.jpeg","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0af4910acb27b5410169babc166988819196380c1ff993d42d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":10270,"output":568,"cacheRead":12544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23382,"cost":{"input":0.025675000000000003,"output":0.00852,"cacheRead":0.003136,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.037331}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773845524521}}
